oud security findings (permissions, misconfigurations, detections), out of box vendor rules, accuracy of detection and identify false positives to fine tune the solution. Partner with cloud architects, DevOps, IT Service owners, and SOC teams to ensure cloud security controls are met, and support incidents management when required. Requirements Hands on experience with cloud native application security solution and cloud security posture management tools e.g. CrowdStrike, Wiz, Orca, Prisma cloud Cyber security experience with cloud security (AWS, GCP, Azure, AliCloud) risks and controls does a violation present a material risk, why and potential impact. Strong collaboration and stakeholders management Experience in building and deploying applications on the Cloud, using CI/CD frameworks and Infrastructure automation, such as: Jenkins, Terraform, Ansible, GitHub, Nexus and Jenkins. Extensive working knowledge of software development tools and technologies; specifically, Python, Bash, PowerShell, SQL, and data formats such as XML, JSON, CSV Nice to have: CSP security certificate e.g. AWS/GCP/Azure certified security speciality,\n\nKey Skills: Cloud Security,CNAPP,Cyber security,Infrastructure Automation,Cloud native application security,PowerShell,Azure,Orca"},{"title":"Cloud Solutions Architect","company":"National Oilwell Varco","location":"Kochi","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-cloud-solutions-architect-national-oilwell-varco-kochi-10-to-17-years-160926000431","source":"naukri","experience":"10-17 Yrs","skills":[14,103,104],"is_walkin":false,"description":"This role is intended for an experienced Cloud Architect with strong cloud and backend development expertise who enjoys building reliable software systems that integrate with industrial equipment. The Cloud Solutions Architect will implement, deploy, and sustain cloud-connected applications, backend services, software infrastructure, and shared technology platforms supporting NOV's Service Equipment product portfolio. Working closely with engineering leadership and system architects, this individual will translate architectural direction into scalable, production-ready solutions while providing technical mentorship, promoting software engineering best practices, and taking ownership of the reliability, maintainability, and continuous improvement of the software platform. \n Responsibilities Develop, maintain, and support cloud-based software platforms and backend services supporting NOV Service Equipment products. Design, implement, and maintain AWS infrastructure, deployment pipelines, containerized applications, and production software environments. Collaborate with engineering teams to integrate industrial equipment with cloud services, databases, APIs, and enterprise applications. Troubleshoot complex software, infrastructure, networking, and system integration issues across development and production environments. Establish and promote software engineering best practices including code reviews, testing, documentation, and deployment processes. Mentor software engineers through technical guidance, design reviews, and collaborative problem solving. Develop reusable software frameworks and shared platform capabilities that support multiple product lines. Support software validation, release management, and remote deployment activities for production systems. Take technical ownership of assigned software platforms and proactively identify opportunities to improve reliability, scalability, security, and maintainability. \n Qualifications Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Computer Engineering or applicable experience. Minimum of 10 years of professional software engineering experience developing and supporting production software systems. Demonstrated experience designing, deploying, and maintaining cloud-based applications using Amazon Web Services (AWS). Strong experience developing backend software, REST APIs, databases, containerized applications, and modern software development practices. Excellent written and verbal English communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively in a remote engineering environment. United State travel Visa preferred. \n Success Factors: Demonstrates technical ownership by taking responsibility for software platforms and driving complex technical issues through resolution. Builds reliable, maintainable, and scalable software systems with a long-term product mindset. Communicates proactively, collaborates effectively across distributed engineering teams, and mentors other engineers through technical leadership. Continuously evaluates opportunities to improve software architecture, development processes, deployment practices, and operational reliability. Approaches technical challenges with curiosity, professionalism, and a commitment to delivering high-quality engineering solutions.\n\nKey Skills: Scalability,AWS Cloud,Reliability,AWS,Rest APIs,Security,API,Cloud"},{"title":"Lead ADAS Engineer","company":"ROSH.AI","location":"Kochi","date_posted":"2026-09-17","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-lead-adas-engineer-rosh-ai-kochi-8-to-12-years-170926912270","source":"naukri","experience":"8-12 Yrs","skills":[1,5,41],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Lead Autonomous Systems/Robotics Software Engineer with 8+ years of experience in ADAS, autonomy, ROS/ROS2, C++, Python, perception, localization, sensor fusion, motion planning, and embedded systems.\n\nKey Skills: Slam,Navigation,Sensor Fusion,Robotics,Radar,LIDAR,Autonomous Vehicle,Adas"},{"title":"OSB Oracle SOA suite","company":"Purview Services","location":"Kochi","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-osb-oracle-soa-suite-purview-services-kochi-6-to-10-years-160926917014","source":"naukri","experience":"6-10 Yrs","skills":[12,102,103],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Role & responsibilities \n Primary Skills description Minimum 6 years expe