ctives, contributing regular fresh campaign ideas.\n* Use AI tools such as ChatGPT and Claude for content creation, ideation, copywriting, and workflow efficiency.\n* Prepare monthly performance reports covering both overall account performance and individual post\\-level performance, with actionable insights.\n* Prepare and maintain automated reports and documentation to streamline recurring reporting and keep records organized.\n* Create professional PowerPoint (PPT) presentations for reports, campaign reviews, and internal/external use.\n* Monitor and analyze social media metrics using analytics tools to track reach, engagement, and growth.\n* Manage and maintain the Google My Business (GMB) page, including responding to reviews and keeping information up to date.\n* Respond to comments, messages, reviews, and inquiries to foster active community engagement.\n* Stay updated on social media trends, algorithms, and best practices to optimize strategies.\n* Collaborate with the marketing team to align social media efforts with broader marketing goals.\n* Handle video shooting and editing to create professional, engaging multimedia content (added advantage).\n\n\n**Requirements**\n* 1\u20133 years of experience managing multiple social media accounts (agency or in\\-house).\n* Hands\\-on experience across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, Twitter (X), YouTube, and GMB.\n* Proficiency in using AI tools like ChatGPT and Claude for content and ideation.\n* Ability to prepare clear, insightful monthly reports (overall and post\\-wise).\n* Ability to prepare and maintain automated reports and documentation.\n* Proficiency in preparing professional PowerPoint (PPT) presentations.\n* Strong campaign ideation, writing, and creative skills.\n* Proficiency in design software and basic video editing/shooting is an added advantage.\n* Familiarity with analytics and scheduling tools.\n\n\n**Why Join Us?**\n At Inkarp, you will have the opportunity to grow and sharpen your creative skills in a dynamic and innovative environment. Join us to work on exciting projects and contribute to a company that values creativity and excellence.\n   \n\n  \n\n**What We Offer**\n* A dynamic work environment in the scientific instruments industry.\n* Opportunity to work on meaningful, technically rich content.\n* Learning and professional growth opportunities.\n\n\n**How To Apply**\n Send your resume to:\n **recruit@inkarp.co.in**\n Subject: Application \u2013 Social Media Executive","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468259360","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468259360"},{"title":"Senior Manager, Marketing & Communication","company":"Svaya Robotics","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468303309","source":"linkedin","experience":"Senior","skills":[7,101,103,105,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**About The Role**\n As\n **Senior** \n**Manager, Marketing \\& Communication** \n , you will work closely with senior management to craft and implement Svaya\u2019s broad marketing strategy and roadmap. You will be working closely with product, technology and sales teams to communicate our brand positioning clearly and consistently across digital and physical channels. At Svaya, despite our technological advancements, we know the customers we work with are buying value, not technology and the ideal candidate will blend deep technical curiosity with passion for impactful storytelling and content creation to communicate our unique value proposition. You will own how our class\\-leading products and technological innovation will translate into compelling, real\\-world value for customer, partners, and the boarder eco\\-system. You should have proven experience leading and driving marketing for industrials and B\\-2\\-B selling.\n   \n\n  \n\n Your Work\n   \n\n  \n\n* Define and evolve new marketing plans and strategies that are differentiated and clearly communicate the overarching value of Svaya product portfolio and technology platform\n* Coordinate communication strategy and execution across all marketing areas including social media, sponsorships, and public relations\n* Partner closely with sales and product teams to communicate the product story and drive planned marketing activities such as roadshows, webinars, customer demos, and trade shows.\n* Synthesize market intelligence gathering market analysis reports, sales wins and losses, competitive intelligence and customer feedback to synthesize our go\\-to\\-market strategy\n* Drive demand generation strategies with data\\-driven insights and market trends to set clear priorities for demand generation in\\-tune with our product and platform capabilities\n* Partner with external creative marketing agencies to craft and effectively communicate our brand positioning and storytelling\n* Drive PR and communications program across multiple channels \u2013 social, press, and events.\n\n\n What We're Looking for\n   \n\n  \n\n* 8\\+ years\u2019 experience in product marketing, with a proven track record in driving B\\-to\\-B marketing and communications strategies for industrial products and/or platform technologies\n* Persuasive communicator with sharp knack for copyright and content creation\n* Master storyteller who can translate complex technical functionality into clear narratives for both technical buyers and non\\-technical executives that influence corporate purchasing decisions\n* Collaborative and pragmatic and partner closely with both internal and external stakeholders without formal authority\n* Should have experience with both digital marketing tools and effective coordination with creative marketing partners\n* Comfortable working in a fast\\-paced startup environment where formal structure is still taking shape\n* Demonstrated strong and effective verbal, written, and interpersonal communication skills\n* Superior organizational and analytical skills with keen attention to detail and quality\n* A strong bias for action with deep insight balancing big\\-picture with execution for tangible results and be able to negotiate and bring clarity in ambiguous situations\n\n\n Education\n   \n\n  \n\n Any Degree or MBA backed by proven marketing experience","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468303309","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468303309"},{"title":"Senior Marketing Manager","company":"Flexiple","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468367995","source":"linkedin","experience":"5-10 Yrs","skills":[7,104,105,107,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Senior Marketing Manager** \n\n\n\n\n**A US fintech scaling its India marketing team** \n\n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Hyderabad, India \u2014 hybrid\n \n\n\n\n**About the Company** \n\n\n\n\n A fast\\-scaling US fintech is building out its India marketing team and has partnered with Flexiple to hire a senior leader to anchor it. You will set strategy for a company moving quickly in a high\\-trust category, with room to build a team beneath you. Flexiple is a managed marketplace that helps global companies build high\\-performing teams and GCCs in India.\n \n\n\n\n**Role Overview** \n\n\n\n\n As a Senior Marketing Manager, you will own the marketing strategy and its execution across channels, mentor a growing team, and be accountable for pipeline, brand, and growth. You will set the direction and then make sure the work ships.\n \n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n\n**Strategy \\& Leadership** \n\n\n\n* Set the marketing strategy and quarterly plan against revenue goals\n* Build, mentor, and manage a team of marketers and specialists\n* Own budget allocation and the case for new channels and bets\n\n\n\n**Growth \\& Performance** \n\n\n\n* Drive demand generation across paid, content, lifecycle, and events\n* Own funnel metrics, attribution, and reporting to the leadership team\n* Partner with sales and product on positioning and go\\-to\\-market\n\n\n\n**Ideal Candidate Profile** \n\n\n\n* 5 to 10 years in marketing with time spent leading or mentoring\n* A record of owning strategy and delivering measurable growth\n* Strong commercial instinct and comfort with data and attribution\n* Clear written and spoken English and a reliable remote\\-work setup\n\n\n\n**Preferred Qualifications** \n\n\n\n* Experience in fintech, SaaS, or a regulated, high\\-trust category\n* Exposure to US or global markets and time\\-zone overlap\n* An MBA or postgraduate qualification in marketing\n\n\n\n**What We Offer** \n\n\n\n* A senior, team\\-building role with a fast\\-scaling US fintech\n* Remote\\-friendly, pan\\-India hiring with long\\-term placement\n* Real ownership of strategy and a direct line to leadership\n* One application considered for this and future matched roles\n\n\n\n**Hiring Process** \n\n\n\n\n HR Screening \u2192 Assignment \u2192 Leadership Round 1 \u2192 Leadership Round 2 \u2192 Culture Fit","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468367995","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468367995"},{"title":"Senior Director - Performance Marketing (Remote)","company":"Puffy","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4454193219","source":"linkedin","experience":"5 Yrs","skills":[7,104,105,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Own the paid media engine for a $1Billion\\+ brand. Decide what to launch and where the budget goes.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Total Annual Package:** \n Up to USD $240,000 \\+ comprehensive benefits (Base salary \\+ monthly performance bonus of up to 20% of base)\n \n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Remote (Global)\n \n\n\n\n**Growth path from here is fluid:** \n all paid channels, including the ones you select, moving toward scope at the intersection of capital allocation, creative strategy, and P\\&L ownership. What takes 4\\-5 years elsewhere happens in 1\\-2 here.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**We've been AI\\-first since December 2023:** \n Every proposal that reaches the CEO ships with an LLM validation link. Your first spend case gets stress\\-tested by an advanced model to eliminate blind spots.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Role Overview:** \n\n\n\n\n Puffy, a market\\-leading, nine\\-figure D2C brand and Top 5 US mattress brand with over $1 billion in sales, is hiring a Senior Director of Performance Marketing to own a multi\\-million\\-dollar monthly paid media engine across Google and Meta with full authority over systems, measurement, creative testing, capital allocation, and team, reporting directly to the CEO.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n This role exists to convert a multi\\-million\\-dollar paid budget into maximum contribution margin, building the decision systems, measurement infrastructure, and team that let the revenue engine run and scale without day\\-to\\-day executive involvement.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**The Problems You'll Own:** \n\n\n\n* **Primary: Decide what to launch and where the budget goes:** \n A multi\\-million\\-dollar monthly budget runs across Google and Meta, and every standard campaign type is already live and optimized: brand and non\\-brand search, PMax, Meta prospecting and retargeting, Shopping and feed. Growth now has to come from what isn't running: new campaign structures, new creative, a different mix of spend.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* **Secondary: Build the system that runs the scaling decisions:** \n Design and document the rules that govern spend, when to pause, when to increase budget, when to pull back, and the measurement each decision depends on. The system should run the scaling without day\\-to\\-day executive oversight.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**The Career Accelerator:** \n\n\n\n\n This is not a role where you manage dashboards and present decks.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* **The scope is scarce** \n : very few Senior Directors of Performance Marketing get simultaneous authority over multi\\-million\\-dollar monthly budgets on both major platforms, full ownership of measurement and creative systems, org design power, and a direct line to the CEO with no layers in between.\n* **Your first 12 months:** \n build pause/hold/scale logic, budget guardrails, and escalation protocols from scratch. Deploy incrementality testing and reconcile platform attribution against backend reality. Architect the creative engine as a system: concept pipeline, testing taxonomy, briefs, hook/hold analytics, UGC, and whitelisting. Design capital allocation on marginal return rather than platform\\-reported averages. Design promo architecture across the retail calendar: pulse strategy, financing offers, funnel alignment. Identify, evaluate, and pilot paid channels beyond Google and Meta. Structure the performance marketing function itself. Shape the future of performance marketing at Puffy, where paid media is the primary growth lever.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What Is In It For You:** \n\n\n\n\n This isn't just another performance marketing role. This is your chance to become a true industry architect.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**1\\. Own the Paid Engine End to End, With No Layers Above You** \n\n\n\n\n You set the strategy, build the systems, and own the outcomes.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* You allocate multi\\-million\\-dollar monthly budgets across Google and Meta on marginal return rather than platform\\-reported averages, design the pause/hold/scale logic and budget guardrails that govern all paid spend, and serve as the single source of truth on paid media performance. Creative runs as a system you architect: concept pipeline, testing taxonomy, briefs, hook/hold analytics, UGC, whitelisting.\n* You hold profitability to a contribution\\-margin standard after returns and financing costs, not ROAS in isolation. You lead, assess, and structure the performance marketing function with org design authority and CEO sign\\-off, reporting directly to the CEO.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**2\\. Join a High\\-Performance Organization and Partner with the 1%:** \n\n\n\n* \ud83c\udfc6 Puffy: Top 5 Mattress Brand in US with Over $1 Billion USD in Sales\n* \ud83c\udf0d Great Place to Work Certified\n* \ud83d\udca1 Work directly with Forbes Council Member CEO. Your vision is the company's vision.\n\n\n\n Gain firsthand exposure to strategic decisions and high\\-velocity execution that drives a global brand\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**3\\. Embrace Radical Flexibility** \n\n\n\n\n Work from anywhere in the world with meaningful time zone overlap. Structure your environment around your best thinking, whether that's a home office, a co\\-working space, (OR) our Dubai headquarters (with full relocation, visa support, and 0% income tax if you choose). Your output is your credential, not your location.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**4\\. Become the Operator Other Brands Try to Hire** \n\n\n\n\n In most companies, performance marketing leaders inherit a system somebody else built and spend the next three years defending its numbers in meetings. Here you build it. When the CEO decides how much capital goes into growth next quarter, your model is the input to that decision, not a report on it afterwards. You'll leave with a paid media system you designed end to end, and the proof that it held contribution margin at scale, which is the part almost nobody in this function can actually show. Puffy has been AI\\-First since December 2023, so you'll build it with an AI\\-native toolbox behind you rather than an agency deck in front of you.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What You'll Need:** \n\n\n\n* 7\\+ years in performance marketing with sustained ownership of $1M\\+/month on both Google and Meta (concurrently or across roles). \"Ownership\" means authority over strategy, structure, and budget, not just execution.\n* Google depth at PMax\\-era: campaign structure, feed management, brand/non\\-brand economics.\n* High\\-AOV considered\\-purchase experience ($1,000\\+ order values): sparse\\-conversion, long\\-decision\\-cycle categories.\n* Personally built, not inherited, bid, budget, and pause decision systems at scale. You'll be asked to present a playbook you authored.\n* Statistical decision literacy: volume gating, false\\-kill vs. wasted\\-spend trade\\-offs, threshold derivation, incrementality test design.\n* Creative testing systems at scale in a post\\-ATT environment: concept\\-vs\\-variation discipline, creative analytics.\n* Team leadership including senior direct reports. Experience building or restructuring a performance marketing function.\n* Structured approach to new channel evaluation: selection frameworks, pilot design, budget allocation, and kill criteria.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Good\\-to\\-Have:** \n\n\n\n* Scripting against Meta/Google APIs; Google Ads Scripts.\n* Mixed agency \\+ in\\-house background.\n* Experience with emerging paid channels (e.g., TikTok, Connected TV, affiliate/partnerships, etc.).\n* D2C e\\-commerce background in home goods, furniture, or comparable high\\-AOV verticals.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**The Puffy DNA:** \n\n\n\n\n We're restless, perpetually hungry, and fast\\-paced, driven by an unwavering belief that we can outperform any competitor, regardless of their size.\n \n\n\n* **Be the Owner:** \n We don't hire employees; we welcome owners. You're accountable for results, not activity.\n* **Execute with Urgency:** \n We thrive in high\\-stakes environments by making thoughtful decisions quickly and acting decisively.\n* **Demand Excellence:** \n We solve the hard problems that others can't, pushing the boundaries of our craft.\n* **Be AI\\-First:** \n Daily multi\\-turn AI conversations challenge your assumptions.\n* **Go All\\-In:** \n When the mission demands it, we rally as one team to cross the finish line.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\u2728 Your Total Compensation \\& Benefits:** \n\n\n\n* \ud83d\udcb0\n **Compensation:** \n Total Annual Package: Up to USD $240,000 \\+ comprehensive benefits (Base salary \\+ monthly performance bonus of up to 20% of base)\n\n\n\n Annual salary review every January\n \n\n\n* \ud83c\udfe5\n **Health \\& Protection:** \n Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision insurance (based on country of hire)\n* \ud83c\udf34\n **Time Off:** \n Generous Paid Time Off (PTO) \\+ Public holidays\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \ud83d\udcbc\n **Work Environment:** \n\n\n\n* AI\\-First organization with access to AI\\-native tool stack\n* Remote First: Work from the comfort of your home office\n* Learning \\& development opportunities\n* International team collaboration across 16\\+ nationalities. Your assumptions get challenged daily.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6 Rewards \\& Recognition:** \n\n\n\n* Eligibility for selection to the Leaders Club, an elite recognition program featuring premium wellness memberships, exclusive networking with senior leadership, and annual leadership retreats\n* Eligibility for nomination as 'We Are' Champion of the Month, monthly recognition with gift vouchers and company\\-wide celebration for exceptional contributions\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Ready to Shape Your Story?** \n\n\n\n\n Click \"Apply\" and take the first step.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4454193219","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4454193219"},{"title":"Social Media Manager - Restaurants and F&B","company":"Tangy Tech Media","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468396032","source":"linkedin","experience":"6 Yrs","skills":[7,103,107,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Social Media Manager \u2013 Restaurants \\& F\\&B** \n\n\n\n\n**Tangy Tech Media \\| Hospitality, Restaurants \\& F\\&B** \n\n\n\n\n Hybrid \\| Travel / on\\-ground presence for clients, shoots and launches as required\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n If you\u2019ve spent the last few years managing too many brands, filling content calendars, chasing trends and measuring success by whether you posted enough this month \\- this role is probably going to feel different.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We\u2019re looking for a\n **Social Media Manager** \n who understands restaurants and F\\&B beyond Instagram.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Someone who can walk into a restaurant, understand what makes it interesting, find the stories hiding inside the business, and turn those stories into content people want to watch, save, share \\- and eventually experience for themselves.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n This is not a high\\-volume social media role.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n It is a chance to work closely on a smaller but high\\-stakes portfolio of hospitality brands, go deeper into each business and build social media that contributes to\n **brand relevance, desirability, discovery and growth.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\\#Why this could be an important career move:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n There are plenty of social media roles where you can manage 10\\-20 accounts. This isn't one of them.\n \n\n\n\n At Tangy Tech Media, we are deliberately building around\n **quality over volume** \n .\n \n\n\n\n You will work closely with restaurant founders, chefs and hospitality teams and be involved much earlier than the point at which somebody says: \"We need six reels for next month.\"\n \n\n\n\n You'll understand the brand strategy. You'll understand the guest.\n \n\n\n\n You'll understand the restaurant, the food, the people behind it and what the business is trying to achieve.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Then you'll decide what the brand should be saying \\- and how social media can bring that to life.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n For the right person, this is an opportunity to move from\n **managing social media** \n to becoming someone who can\n **build hospitality brands through content.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\\#What you'll own:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You will take responsibility for the social media and content direction of the brands assigned to you \\- from thinking through the strategy to making sure the work actually gets executed.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n That includes:\n \n\n\n\n \\* Building social media strategies based on the brand's positioning, business objectives and target guest \\- not generic monthly content buckets.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Translating brand strategy into strong, recognisable content pillars and recurring formats.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Developing monthly and campaign\\-led content plans across Instagram and other relevant social platforms.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Identifying the stories worth telling \\- founders, chefs, dishes, ingredients, producers, design, culture, people, processes, experiences and everything happening behind the restaurant.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Writing strong briefs for reels, photography, video, design and campaign content.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Working with photographers, videographers, designers, creators and client teams to bring those ideas to life.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Directing shoots from a content and storytelling perspective.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Writing or shaping captions and social copy so that every brand develops its own voice rather than sounding like another restaurant account.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Planning restaurant launches, menu launches, collaborations, events, seasonal campaigns and cultural moments across social.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Building content around PR moments, influencer activity, partnerships and campaigns so that social doesn't operate in isolation.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Understanding what's happening culturally and digitally without turning every brand into a trend\\-chasing account.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Managing publishing, community interaction and day\\-to\\-day social media hygiene.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Reviewing performance and turning insights into better creative and strategic decisions.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Tracking the metrics that matter \\- reach and engagement, certainly, but also discovery, enquiries, reservations, campaign response, audience quality and other indicators relevant to the business.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Presenting ideas and recommendations confidently to founders and senior client teams.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Taking ownership when something isn't working and changing course instead of waiting to be told what to do next.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\\#What we are not looking for** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We're not looking for someone whose idea of social media strategy is: \"Monday \\- motivational post. Wednesday \\- reel. Friday \\- carousel.\"\n \n\n\n\n We're also not looking for someone who relies entirely on trending audio, meme formats or copying what another restaurant did last week.\n \n\n\n\n And this isn't a role for someone who wants to receive a brief, execute exactly what's written and move to the next task.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We want someone who\n **thinks** \n . Someone who asks:\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Why would anybody care about this?\n \n\n\n\n Why would somebody save this?\n \n\n\n\n What does this tell them about the restaurant?\n \n\n\n\n Could any other restaurant have posted this exact piece of content?\n \n\n\n\n What makes someone want to visit after seeing it?\n \n\n\n\n What does this brand need to become known for?\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**\\#Who we're looking for:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You should ideally have\n **3\u20136 years of experience in social media, content or digital marketing** \n , with meaningful experience working on\n **restaurants, F\\&B, hospitality or closely related lifestyle brands.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You should already understand that hospitality content is its own discipline.\n \n\n\n\n A beautifully shot dish isn't automatically a good piece of content.\n \n\n\n\n Neither is a founder talking into a camera.\n \n\n\n\n Neither is a reel with 500,000 views if nobody remembers which restaurant it came from.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**We're particularly interested in people who can demonstrate:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\* Strong restaurant/F\\&B social media work.\n \n\n\n\n \\* The ability to develop ideas rather than simply execute calendars.\n \n\n\n\n \\* A strong visual eye and understanding of photography, video and design.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Good copy and storytelling instincts.\n \n\n\n\n \\* An understanding of what makes restaurant brands culturally relevant.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Experience briefing and directing photographers, videographers, designers or creators.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Confidence working directly with founders, chefs and senior stakeholders.\n \n\n\n\n \\* Strong organisation and the ability to move several pieces of work forward without constant supervision.\n \n\n\n\n\n \\*\n \n Comfort analysing social media performance and making decisions from the numbers.\n \n\n\n\n\n \\*\n \n Curiosity about restaurants, food, hospitality, culture, design and consumer behaviour.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Agency experience is useful.** \n\n\n\n\n**Hospitality experience is considerably more important.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What you can build here:** \n\n\n\n\n We want this person to become far more than the person who manages our clients' social media accounts.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n As Tangy Tech Media grows, there is room for you to develop into someone who can lead social and content strategy across our hospitality portfolio.\n \n\n\n\n That means building your ability to:\n \n\n\n1. Think strategically \\- Understand where a restaurant wants to go before deciding what it should post.\n2. Build brands \\- Develop recognisable voices, visual worlds and content properties rather than disposable social posts.\n3. Work commercially \\- Understand how content connects with restaurant discovery, demand, launches, reservations, repeat visitation and brand growth.\n4. .Lead creatively \\- Develop ideas and guide photographers, videographers, designers, creators and younger social talent.\n5. Build a serious hospitality portfolio \\- Work deeply with a smaller number of restaurants and F\\&B businesses rather than having your name attached to dozens of accounts you barely had time to understand.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**About Tangy Tech Media** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Tangy Tech Media is a hospitality\\-focused growth marketing, PR and brand strategy company working with restaurants, F\\&B businesses and hotels.\n \n\n\n\n Our work sits across brand strategy, PR, social media, content, partnerships, creators, campaigns, launches and growth. We believe the strongest hospitality marketing doesn't begin with deciding what to post. It begins by understanding: What should this brand become? And then using every communication channel to build that position consistently.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n That philosophy also shapes how our team works.\n \n\n\n\n We would rather do meaningful work for a smaller number of ambitious hospitality businesses than become another agency running dozens of accounts through a content factory.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**The kind of person who will thrive here:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n1. You have high standards for your own work.\n2. You notice details.\n3. You're curious.\n4. You can defend an idea but you can also recognise when another idea is better.\n5. You don't need somebody constantly following up with you.\n6. You're comfortable working in a founder\\-led environment where good ideas can come from anywhere \\- but ownership matters.\n7. And you're excited by the idea of becoming very good at restaurant and hospitality social media, rather than remaining a generalist managing whichever category lands on your desk next.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**To apply: Please send us:** \n\n\n\n1. Your updated CV to hr@tangytechmedia.com\n2. Your current and expected compensation.\n3. Your notice period / earliest joining date.\n4. Links to 2\\-3 restaurant, F\\&B or hospitality brands you've worked on.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**For at least one of them, tell us briefly:** \n\n\n\n1. What you were responsible for.\n2. What you changed or introduced.\n3. What happened as a result.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We're less interested in seeing 50 Instagram handles.\n \n\n\n\n We'd rather understand what you actually contributed to three of them.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Role:** \n Social Media Manager \\- Restaurants \\& F\\&B\n \n\n\n\n**Tangy Tech Media**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468396032","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468396032"},{"title":"Social Media Specialist DNSM27","company":"Digital Nest","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467185667","source":"linkedin","experience":"6 Yrs","skills":[103,107,117],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Social Media Specialist (Content Creator)**\n\n**Department:** \n Marketing / Digital Marketing\n   \n\n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Hyderabad / On\\-site\n   \n\n**Experience:** \n 3\u20136 years\n   \n\n**Reporting To:** \n Content Manager / Marketing Manager\n   \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n**Role Overview**\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The Social Media Specialist will be responsible for managing Digital Nest\u2019s social media presence while actively creating content for platforms. This includes ideating, scripting, shooting, editing, and sometimes featuring in content such as reels, videos, and campaigns. The role requires a strong mix of creativity, on\\-camera confidence, and platform understanding to drive engagement and brand visibility.\n   \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities**\n**Social Media Management** \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n \u2022 Manage and grow platforms like Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, and others.\n   \n\n \u2022 Plan and execute structured content calendars.\n   \n\n \u2022 Schedule and publish posts consistently.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Content Creation (Core Responsibility)** \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n \u2022 Ideate and create short\\-form and long\\-form content (reels, videos, posts).\n   \n\n \u2022 Script, shoot, and edit content independently or with the team.\n   \n\n \u2022 Feature in videos when required (explainers, reels, brand content).\n   \n\n \u2022 Experiment with formats, storytelling styles, and trends.\n **Trend \\& Platform Strategy**\n \u2022 Stay updated with social media trends, algorithms, and viral formats.\n   \n\n \u2022 Identify and leverage trends relevant to the brand.\n   \n\n \u2022 Adapt content strategies based on platform performance.\n   \n\n**Collaboration**\n \u2022 Work closely with designers, copywriters, and marketing teams.\n   \n\n \u2022 Align content with ongoing campaigns and brand messaging.\n   \n\n \u2022 Coordinate for shoots, creatives, and campaign deliverables.\n   \n\n**Audience Engagement**\n \u2022 Respond to comments, DMs, and audience interactions.\n   \n\n \u2022 Build a strong online community and brand personality.\n   \n\n**Performance \\& Optimization**\n \u2022 Track engagement, reach, and growth metrics.\n   \n\n \u2022 Analyze what content performs best and optimize accordingly.\n   \n\n \u2022 Continuously improve content quality and effectiveness.\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n Requirements\n   \n\n  \n\n**Skills \\& Competencies**\n**Core Skills** \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n \u2022 Strong content creation skills (video\\-first mindset)\n   \n\n \u2022 Basic video shooting and editing (mobile or tools)\n   \n\n \u2022 Creative storytelling and idea generation\n   \n\n \u2022 Social media platform expertise\n   \n\n  \n\n**Functional Skills** \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n \u2022 Reels, short\\-form video, and trending formats\n   \n\n \u2022 Scriptwriting and content structuring\n   \n\n \u2022 Basic analytics and performance tracking\n   \n\n \u2022 Familiarity with editing tools (CapCut, Premiere Pro, etc.)\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n**Soft Skills** \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n \u2022 Confidence in front of the camera\n   \n\n \u2022 Creativity and adaptability\n   \n\n \u2022 Fast execution and trend responsiveness\n   \n\n \u2022 Strong communication and collaboration\n   \n\n**Qualifications**\n \u2022 Bachelor\u2019s degree in Marketing, Media, Communications, or related fields\n   \n\n \u2022 Certifications in social media or digital marketing are a plus\n   \n\n**Experience**\n \u2022 3\u20136 years in social media, content creation, or digital marketing\n   \n\n \u2022 Experience creating video content (portfolio required)\n   \n\n \u2022 Prior experience in startups, agencies, or creator\\-led roles preferred","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467185667","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467185667"},{"title":"Edtech - Social Media Executive/Content Creator","company":"Techeon IT","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467186523","source":"linkedin","experience":"2 Yrs","skills":[107,109],"is_walkin":false,"description":"EdTech \\- Content Creator / Social Media Executive\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Location** \n : Hyderabad\n \n\n\n\n**Experience** \n : 1\\-2 Year (internship experience counts)\n \n\n\n\n**Employment Type** \n : Full\\-Time\n \n\n\n\n**Working Days** \n : Monday to Saturday\n \n\n\n\n**Joining** \n : Immediate Joiner Preferred\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**About the Role** \n\n\n\n\n We are looking for a creative and energetic Content Creator who can independently come up with fresh content ideas, write engaging scripts, and create short\\-form videos and UGC (User\\-Generated Content) for social media and digital marketing campaigns.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Develop creative and engaging content ideas independently.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Write short\\-form video scripts, captions, hooks, and social media content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create and appear in short\\-form videos, Reels, and UGC content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Shoot and coordinate video content for Instagram, YouTube, and other platforms.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create content aligned with brand and marketing objectives.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Collaborate with the marketing team on campaigns and content calendars.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Monitor social media trends and develop relevant, trend\\-based content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experiment with different content formats to improve engagement and reach.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Requirements** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 1\\-2 year of experience in Content Creation, Social Media, UGC, or a related field.\n \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 English and Hindi \u2013 Mandatory.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience in Edtech\n \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong creative writing and storytelling skills.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to independently generate content ideas and scripts.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Comfortable creating and appearing in videos.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Basic knowledge of video shooting/editing and social media platforms.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Good understanding of Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, and UGC content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Energetic, confident, and comfortable in front of the camera.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Freshers with strong content portfolios/projects are also welcome.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Immediate joiners preferred.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467186523","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467186523"},{"title":"Sales And Marketing Intern","company":"CloudNexus","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466865174","source":"linkedin","experience":"1 Yrs","skills":[35,103,105,106,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Sales \\& Marketing Intern** \n\n\n\n\n**Company:** \n CloudNexus\n \n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Hyderabad, Telangana\n \n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n Fresher / 0\u20131 Year\n \n\n\n\n**Stipend:** \n \u20b910,000\n \n\n\n\n \u00a0\n \n\n\n\n**About CloudNexus** \n\n\n\n\n At\n **CloudNexus** \n , we are more than just an IT consulting company we are innovators, problem\\-solvers, and architects of the digital future. We specialize in cloud transformation, AI\\-driven automation, DevOps, cybersecurity, and enterprise technology solutions.\n \n\n\n\n \u00a0\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Skills** \n\n\n\n* **Sales:** \n Lead generation, prospecting, follow\\-ups, and customer engagement\n* **Marketing:** \n Digital marketing, social media, email marketing, and campaign support\n* **Market Research:** \n Target audience, competitor, and market analysis\n* **CRM:** \n Maintaining leads and customer information\n* **Analytics:** \n Tracking leads, conversions, and campaign performance\n* **Communication:** \n Strong verbal, written, and presentation skills\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n* Generate and qualify leads through online and offline channels.\n* Assist with\n **sales and marketing campaigns** \n to generate business opportunities.\n* Identify potential customers and conduct regular follow\\-ups.\n* Support social media, email, and digital marketing activities.\n* Conduct basic market and competitor research.\n* Maintain and update\n **CRM and marketing databases** \n .\n* Track lead generation and campaign performance.\n* Collaborate with the sales and marketing team to achieve business targets.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Candidate Profile** \n\n\n\n* Graduate or pursuing a degree in\n **Marketing, Business Administration, Management, or a related field** \n .\n* Freshers with strong\n **communication and interpersonal skills** \n are welcome.\n* Interest in\n **Sales, Marketing, Business Development, and Digital Marketing** \n .\n* Confident, proactive, target\\-oriented, and willing to learn.\n* Internship, academic projects, or certifications in\n **Sales/Marketing** \n will be an advantage.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* **Interested candidates can apply with their updated resume.**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466865174","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466865174"},{"title":"Deputy General Manager/General Manager- Marketing Head","company":"Nextenti Tech Private Limited","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468619103","source":"linkedin","experience":"20 Yrs","skills":[103,104,106,107,108,112,115],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Position:** \n Marketing Head \u2013 DGM / GM\n \n\n\n\n**Industry:** \n Healthcare / Hospital\n \n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n 18\u201320 Years\n \n\n\n\n Job Summary\n \n\n\n\n We are looking for an experienced\n **Marketing Head \u2013 DGM / GM** \n to lead the overall marketing function of a reputed hospital/healthcare organization. The role will be responsible for developing and executing strategic marketing initiatives to drive\n **business growth, patient acquisition, brand visibility, corporate partnerships, and digital presence** \n .\n \n\n\n\n Key Responsibilities\n \n\n\n* Develop and implement the overall\n **hospital marketing strategy** \n aligned with business objectives.\n* Lead and manage the complete marketing function across\n **strategic, corporate, digital, branding, and patient acquisition** \n initiatives.\n* Drive\n **patient acquisition and revenue growth** \n through targeted marketing campaigns and referral strategies.\n* Strengthen the hospital's\n **brand positioning, visibility, and market presence** \n .\n* Develop and manage\n **corporate marketing and institutional partnerships** \n .\n* Lead\n **digital marketing, social media, online campaigns, SEO/SEM, and digital patient engagement** \n initiatives.\n* Identify new market opportunities, emerging healthcare trends, and competitor activities.\n* Plan and execute marketing campaigns for\n **new services, specialties, doctors, and hospital facilities** \n .\n* Build strong relationships with\n **corporates, TPAs, insurance companies, referral networks, and other healthcare stakeholders** \n .\n* Monitor marketing performance through\n **KPIs, ROI, patient acquisition metrics, and campaign effectiveness** \n .\n* Manage marketing budgets and ensure effective utilization of resources.\n* Lead, mentor, and develop the marketing team to achieve organizational targets.\n* Coordinate with\n **hospital operations, doctors, business development, HR, and senior management** \n to ensure effective execution of marketing plans.\n* Prepare regular\n **marketing performance reports and strategic recommendations** \n for senior management.\n\n\n\n Desired Candidate Profile\n \n\n\n* **18\u201320 years of overall experience** \n , with significant experience in\n **healthcare/hospital marketing** \n .\n* Strong preference for candidates who have\n **led the marketing function of reputed hospitals or healthcare organizations** \n .\n* Proven experience in\n **strategic marketing, patient acquisition, branding, corporate marketing, and business growth** \n .\n* Strong leadership and team\\-management skills.\n* Excellent communication, negotiation, presentation, and stakeholder\\-management abilities.\n* Strong understanding of the\n **hospital/healthcare market and patient acquisition ecosystem** \n .\n* Ability to work closely with senior leadership and drive organization\\-wide marketing initiatives.\n\n\n\n Key Skills\n \n\n\n\n**Healthcare Marketing \\| Hospital Marketing \\| Strategic Planning \\| Patient Acquisition \\| Brand Management \\| Business Growth \\| Corporate Marketing \\| Digital Marketing \\| Business Development \\| Team Leadership \\| Market Analysis \\| ROI \\& KPI Management**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468619103","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468619103"},{"title":"Director of Admissions and Marketing","company":"Oakridge International School, Gachibowli","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467195404","source":"linkedin","experience":"22 Yrs","skills":[7,100,103,104,106,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Job Posting Date: 5 Sept 2026\n   \n\n  \n\n Location:\n   \n\n  \n\n Gachibowli, IN\n   \n\n  \n\n Job ID: 10034\n   \n\n  \n\n School: Oakridge International School Gachibowli\n   \n\n  \n\n Company: Nord Anglia Education\n   \n\n  \n\n Oakridge Gachibowli is a premium international day school in India. We have the proud privilege of being the pioneers of IB schooling in South India and one of the largest providers of IB education in India. We have 150\\+ IB\\-trained teachers with years of experience, helping us consistently achieve outstanding results and seeing our students go on to study at some of the world\u2019s leading universities. Oakridge offers IB, CBSE, and Cambridge curricula, and is recognized as one of the best schools in Hyderabad, India.\n   \n\n  \n\n Oakridge International School, Gachibowli is a leading premium day school in India, with more than 2800 students in full time enrollment. The school has a proud legacy of 22 years educational excellence and of being the pioneers of IB schooling in South India and one of the largest providers of IB education in India. The school has 150\\+ IB\\-trained teachers, enabling consistent outstanding results and inspire students go on to study at some of the world\u2019s leading universities. The school serves Nursery through to high school (Grade 12\\) students. Oakridge offers IB, CBSE, and Cambridge curricula, and is recognized as one of the best schools in Hyderabad, India.\n   \n\n  \n\n The Oakridge International School, Gachibowli is partnered with the Nord Anglia Education family, the world\u2019s leading premium international school organisation. They currently have 81 schools in India, China, Europe, the Middle East, South East Asia and North, Central and South America. NAE are a fast growing, successful education company with over 50 years\u2019 experience. The schools are amongst the most respected premium schools in their markets and are a very popular choice for parents.\n   \n\n  \n\n Short Description\n   \n\n  \n\n**Job Purpose**\n* As Director of Admissions \\& Marketing (DAM), you\u2019ll be a member of the school Senior Leadership Team (SLT) with prime responsibility for driving student enrolment.\n* You\u2019ll do this by ensuring families receive an exceptional experience at each stage of their journey with our school \\- from awareness and consideration, through to enrolment and advocacy. We call this our Family Experience Journey, and everything we do in MAC (Marketing, Admissions and Communications) revolves around this.\n* To deliver an exceptional family experience each and every time, you\u2019ll need to forge great relationships with colleagues from across the school, so that everyone is working together to achieve our vision.\n* As an exceptional leader of people, you\u2019ll coach and develop the commercial, creative and customer\\-orientated skills of your team, and be a consummate ambassador for the school brand.\n* As a DAM, you\u2019ll also play a pivotal role in building the school community and reputation\n\n\n**Job Description**\n**Click here for Job Description :** \n DAM \\- Gachibowli.docx\n   \n\n  \n\n Job Responsibilities\n   \n\n  \n\n**Required Skills/Abilities**\n Required Skills / Abilities\n   \n\n  \n\n* Strategic Admissions \\& Enrollment Management\n* Marketing Strategy \\& Brand Management\n* Leadership and Team Management\n* Customer Relationship Management (CRM)\n* Data Analysis \\& Reporting\n* Digital Marketing \\& Social Media\n* Project Management\n* Stakeholder Relationship Management\n* Communication \\& Presentation Skills\n* Business Development\n* Market Research \\& Competitor Analysis\n* Campaign Planning \\& Execution\n* Customer Experience Management\n* Decision\\-Making \\& Problem Solving\n* Negotiation \\& Influencing Skills\n\n\n At Nord Anglia Education we are committed to providing a world class, safe, happy environment in which children and young people can thrive and learn. We are committed to safeguarding and promoting the welfare of all our pupils where we embrace all race, abilities, religions, genders, and cultures.\n   \n\n  \n\n All post holders in regulated activity (having regular unsupervised contact with children) are subject to appropriate national and international vetting procedures including satisfactory criminal record checks from both your country of residence/birth and any country of residence within the last 10 years.\n   \n\n  \n\n We welcome applications from suitable qualified persons from all diverse backgrounds.\n   \n\n  \n\n Please note, only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467195404","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467195404"},{"title":"Copywriter","company":"WTX India","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466247698","source":"linkedin","experience":"2 Yrs","skills":[103,107,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Location \\- Hyderabad** \n\n\n\n\n**Job Type \\- Full time** \n\n\n\n\n**Experience \\- 2 Years** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We are looking for a creative and enthusiastic Copywriter to join our team. This role is ideal for someone passionate about writing and storytelling, who can craft compelling content for digital platforms while learning and growing in a fast\\-paced creative environment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Responsibilities:** \n\n\n\n* Write clear, engaging, and creative copy for social media, websites, ads, and marketing campaigns\n* Assist in developing content ideas and campaign concepts\n* Collaborate with designers, marketers, and creative teams\n* Adapt tone and style based on brand guidelines\n* Proofread and edit content to ensure quality and consistency\n* Stay updated with industry trends, pop culture, and digital content formats\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Skills and qualifications:** \n\n\n\n* Strong writing, editing, and proofreading skills\n* Experience in Agency industries is plus\n* Basic understanding of digital marketing and content creation\n* Creativity and attention to detail\n* Ability to meet deadlines and manage multiple tasks\n* Good communication and teamwork skills\n* Familiarity with social media platforms and content trends\n* Portfolio or samples of writing work\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n If you\u2019re passionate about creating impactful videos, send your resume and portfolio to\n **hr@wtxindia.com** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Website \\- https://www.wtxindia.com/","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466247698","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466247698"},{"title":"Growth & Purpose - USI Digital - Associate Data Management - Alumni Relations - Hyderabad","company":"Deloitte","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467505474","source":"linkedin","experience":"3 Yrs","skills":[33,43,44,104,106,107,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Summary**\n**Position Summary**\n Join Deloitte USI\u2019s Alumni Relations Team, where data, strategy, and relationship\\-building come together to power meaningful alumni engagement and business growth. In this role, you\u2019ll help shape high\\-impact marketing and alumni initiatives by maintaining clean, reliable data, building insightful reports and dashboards, and supporting campaigns that keep Deloitte\u2019s \u201ccolleagues for life\u201d network strong, connected, and thriving. It\u2019s a dynamic opportunity for an analytical, detail\\-oriented professional who enjoys turning information into action, collaborating across teams, and making a measurable impact in a fast\\-paced, purpose\\-driven environment.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Work you'll do**\n As an Associate Data Management on the Alumni Relations team, you will be responsible for:\n   \n\n  \n\n* Maintain and cleanse data across customer relationship management (CRM) platforms, including Salesforce, SAP, and Avature, to support accurate contact, account, and campaign records.\n* Develop and manage reports, dashboards, and data outputs that track alumni engagement, account activity, and campaign performance.\n* Analyze large datasets, identify data gaps and root causes of quality issues, and support remediation and standardization efforts aligned with data governance practices.\n* Support newsletter, campaign, and stakeholder reporting activities by preparing data, running queries, and producing insights using Excel and other reporting tools.\n* Collaborate with stakeholders across Audit, Tax, Consulting, and Advisory to support alumni initiatives, meet service level agreements, and maintain confidentiality of alumni information.\n\n\n**The team**\n U.S. India, Clients, Strategy \\& Growth drive the marketing programs, initiatives, and priority client\\-facing programs in the U.S. regions. India Clients, Strategy \\& Growth is focused on quality and operational excellence and is constantly challenging and refining its business model to ensure proper support of marketing processes, services, and deliverables in the United States. The Mission of Clients, Strategy \\& Growth is to support, augment, and complement marketing efforts of Deloitte through the development of marketing and business development materials and services.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Location:** \n Hyderabad\n   \n\n  \n\n**Shift Timings:** \n 2 PM to 11 PM\n   \n\n  \n\n**Qualifications**\n Required:\n   \n\n  \n\n* Master of Business Administration (MBA), preferably with a major in Marketing or Human Resources\n* 1\\-3 years of experience in alumni relations, talent operations, recruiting, marketing, or university relations\n* Experience maintaining, cleansing, and updating data in customer relationship management (CRM) tools such as Salesforce, SAP, Avature, or ServiceNow\n* Proficiency in Microsoft Excel, Outlook, and PowerPoint\n* Experience preparing reports, dashboards, pivots, or campaign tracking outputs using Excel or CRM reporting tools\n\n\n Preferred:\n   \n\n  \n\n* Experience supporting alumni, recruiting, or marketing campaigns\n* Experience building dashboards or data visualizations\n* Experience identifying and resolving data quality issues using data governance standards\n* Experience supporting newsletters, surveys, events, or stakeholder communications\n* Experience working in a professional services firm or large matrixed organization\n\n\n**How You\u2019ll Grow**\n At Deloitte, we\u2019ve invested a great deal to create a rich environment in which our professionals can grow. We want all our people to develop in their own way, playing to their own strengths as they hone their leadership skills. And, as a part of our efforts, we provide our professionals with a variety of learning and networking opportunities\u2014 including exposure to leaders, sponsors, coaches, and challenging assignments\u2014to help accelerate their careers along the way. No two people learn in exactly the same way. So, we provide a range of resources including live classrooms, team\\-based learning, and eLearning. DU: The Leadership Center in India, our state\\-of\\-the\\-art, worldclass learning Center in the Hyderabad offices is an extension of the Deloitte University (DU) in Westlake, Texas, and represents a tangible symbol of our commitment to our people\u2019s growth and development. Explore DU: The Leadership Center in India\n   \n\n  \n\n**Benefits**\n At Deloitte, we know that great people make a great organization. We value our people and offer employees a broad range of benefits. Learn more about what working at Deloitte can mean for you.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Deloitte\u2019s culture**\n Our positive and supportive culture encourages our people to do their best work every day. We celebrate individuals by recognizing their uniqueness and offering them the flexibility to make daily choices that can help them to be healthy, centered, confident, and aware. We offer well\\-being programs and are continuously looking for new ways to maintain a culture that is inclusive, invites authenticity, leverages our diversity, and where our people excel and lead healthy, happy lives. Learn more about Life at Deloitte.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Corporate citizenship**\n Deloitte is led by a purpose: to make an impact that matters. This purpose defines who we are and extends to relationships with our clients, our people and our communities.We believe that business has the power to inspire and transform. We focus on education, giving, skill\\-based volunteerism, and leadership to help drive positive social impact in our communities. Learn more about Deloitte\u2019s impact on the world.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Our purpose**\n Deloitte\u2019s purpose is to make an impact that matters for our people, clients, and communities. At Deloitte, purpose is synonymous with how we work every day. It defines who we are. Our purpose comes through in our work with clients that enables impact and value in their organizations, as well as through our own investments, commitments, and actions across areas that help drive positive outcomes for our communities.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Our people and culture**\n Our inclusive culture empowers our people to be who they are, contribute their unique perspectives, and make a difference individually and collectively. It enables us to leverage different ways of thinking, ideas and perspectives, and bring more creativity and innovation to help solve our clients\u2019 most complex challenges. This makes Deloitte one of the most rewarding places to work.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Professional development**\n At Deloitte, professionals have the opportunity to work with some of the best and discover what works best for them. Here, we prioritize professional growth, offering diverse learning and networking opportunities to help accelerate careers and enhance leadership skills. Our state\\-of\\-the\\-art DU: The Leadership Center in India, located in Hyderabad, represents a tangible symbol of our commitment to the holistic growth and development of our people. Explore DU: The Leadership Center in India .\n   \n\n  \n\n**Benefits To Help You Thrive**\n At Deloitte, we know that great people make a great organization. Our comprehensive rewards program helps us deliver a distinctly Deloitte experience that helps that empowers our professionals to thrive mentally, physically, and financially\u2014and live their purpose. To support our professionals and their loved ones, we offer a broad range of benefits. Eligibility requirements may be based on role, tenure, type of employment and/ or other criteria. Learn more about what working at Deloitte can mean for you.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Recruiting tips**\n From developing a stand out resume to putting your best foot forward in the interview, we want you to feel prepared and confident as you explore opportunities at Deloitte. Check out recruiting tips from Deloitte recruiters.\n   \n\n  \n\n Requisition code: 358194","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467505474","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467505474"},{"title":"Lead Generation Specialist","company":"Midwatt","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466249480","source":"linkedin","experience":"Lead","skills":[103,105,106,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Company Description** \n Midwatt is a Hyderabad\\-based rooftop solar EPC company that enables businesses, factories, and housing societies to adopt solar energy with minimal complexity. The company manages the entire project lifecycle, including system design, procurement, installation, grid approvals, and post\\-installation support. Midwatt focuses on delivering hassle\\-free solar solutions so customers can benefit from clean energy without needing technical expertise. The team is committed to providing reliable, end\\-to\\-end services that simplify the transition to solar power for commercial and residential clients.\n   \n\n**Role Description** \n The Lead Generation Specialist will be responsible for identifying and qualifying new business opportunities for Midwatt\u2019s rooftop solar solutions. This is a full\\-time, on\\-site role based in Hyderabad. Day\\-to\\-day tasks include researching target markets, building and maintaining lead databases, initiating contact with prospective clients via calls, emails, and in person visits, and coordinating with the sales team to schedule meetings and follow\\-ups. The role involves nurturing leads through clear communication, sharing service information, and supporting sales efforts to convert prospects into customers. The specialist will also track lead performance, update CRM records, and collaborate with marketing to refine outreach strategies.\n   \n\n**Qualifications**\n  \n\n* Ability to identify and qualify New Leads and perform effective Lead Generation activities.\n* Strong Communication skills for engaging prospects, presenting solutions, and handling queries.\n* Sales skills to support conversion efforts, manage pipelines, and collaborate with the sales team.\n* Research skills to analyze markets, understand customer segments, and identify potential opportunities.\n* Prior experience in business development, inside sales, or lead generation, preferably in solar, energy, or related sectors.\n* Comfort with using CRM tools and basic office software for tracking and reporting.\n* Ability to work on\\-site in Hyderabad, manage multiple leads, and meet defined targets.\n* Bachelor\u2019s degree in Business, Marketing, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466249480","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466249480"},{"title":"Video Editor-Telugu","company":"Nation with NaMo","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466879393","source":"linkedin","experience":"27 Yrs","skills":[103,104,115,117],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**About Us** \n : \\-\n \n\n\n\n We are India's leading political consulting organization dedicated to provide high quality professional support for political campaigns. We strongly believe that the nation will best benefit from an enlightened political leadership in the form of Prime Minister Narendra Modi and are proud to have previously contributed in a similar capacity in the momentous election campaign of 2014, 2019,2024 and various subsequent state elections.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Our work includes envisioning and executing innovative electioneering campaigns, facilitating capacity building of grassroots cadre and shaping governance. We add professional aspects to the strengths of the scores of grassroots workers supporting the Prime Minister and ensure optimal electoral results not as an end in itself but to add to the Prime Minister's vision for a developed India. Our work leverages on\\-ground activities, data analytics, research and new age media as a force multiplier for the Prime Minister's messages and actions.\n \n\n\n\n \\- We comprise a diverse group of dedicated individuals including former management consultants, lawyers, engineers, political theorists, public policy professionals and other varied sectors from premier institutes and corporates with the unified objective of meaningfully contributing to the polity of the nation.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n A creative and skilled Video Editor who understands short\\-form content, Telugu internet culture, memes, humour, satire and political communication, and can turn briefs, ideas and raw footage into engaging and impactful video content.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Responsibilities**\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Edit Reels, short\\-form videos, meme videos, political content and other social media content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Edit speeches, interviews, news clips, campaign videos, parody videos and other digital content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create video content using original and repurposed footage.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Take a brief, understand the team's needs and specifications, and translate it into effective video communication.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Develop and review scripts and raw material for videos wherever required.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Trim footage segments and put together sequences with logical sequencing, strong pacing and smooth running.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create rough cuts and final cuts based on the requirements.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Add and effectively use music, dialogues, graphics, subtitles, text, sound effects, transitions and visual effects wherever required.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create strong hooks, pacing, transitions and visual storytelling to keep viewers engaged and improve audience retention.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Understand and effectively use Telugu meme formats, humour, satire, internet trends and cultural references.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create engaging political and social\\-media content that is relevant to the target audience.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Work closely with content writers, designers and creative teams to execute ideas and creative briefs in a fast\\-paced work environment.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Consult and coordinate with stakeholders across various teams and incorporate feedback into final outputs.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Consistently create impactful communication collaterals across various mediums.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Stay updated with current video\\-editing trends, viral formats, AI video tools, new content styles, editing technologies and industry best practices, and implement them to improve efficiency and output quality.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Handle multiple projects simultaneously and deliver quality work within tight deadlines.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Requirements**\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 21\u201327 years old.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 1\u20138 years of work experience in an art/design or video\\-editing environment, preferably with an advertising agency (ATL/digital), brand or startup.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong command of Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Proficiency in CapCut or similar editing software.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience with Final Cut is an advantage.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Hands\\-on experience with AI tools for video creation, editing and content production.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Proficiency in Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator and CorelDRAW.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Good understanding of Telugu language and Telugu meme culture.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Good awareness of Telangana, Andhra Pradesh and national politics.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong understanding of short\\-form video, audience retention and current content trends.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong sense of timing, humour, visual storytelling, music and aesthetics.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to create engaging content from raw footage, scripts and basic creative briefs.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to translate a brief into well\\-crafted communication content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Familiarity with special effects, animation, 3D and compositing.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Keen eye for aesthetics, visual quality and attention to detail.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Solid knowledge of design and visual principles.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Creative mind with strong storytelling skills.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Fast, creative and enthusiastic, with the ability to work effectively in a fast\\-paced environment and under pressure.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong multitasking skills and the ability to work methodically and meet deadlines.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Previous experience in political, meme, news or social media video editing is a plus.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Should have experience creating posts, ads or banners for social media in a previous role.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Editing machine/desktop is mandatory.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**P.S. This is a contractual role till June 2027\\.**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466879393","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4466879393"},{"title":"Associate Manager - Strategic Account Management Job","company":"YASH Technologies Middle East","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4465989847","source":"linkedin","experience":"5 Yrs","skills":[7,102,105,106,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"We use cookies to offer you the best possible website experience. Your cookie preferences will be stored in your browser\u2019s local storage. This includes cookies necessary for the website's operation. Additionally, you can freely decide and change any time whether you accept cookies or choose to opt out of cookies to improve website's performance, as well as cookies used to display content tailored to your interests. Your experience of th