 changes in an increasingly virtual world and it drives us beyond generational gaps and disruptions of the future.\n   \n\n  \n\n**We are looking forward to hire Strategic Account Management Professionals in the following areas :**\n**Customer Growth Partner \u2013 Account Management**\n****ABOUT THE ROLE****\n YASH Technologies is seeking a Customer Growth Partner (CGP) to join our global Business Development organization. In this role, you will serve as a strategic enabler bridging Research, Account management and Delivery coordination to help our teams identify new opportunities, retain and grow existing clients, and maintain excellence across markets.\n   \n\n  \n\n This is a dynamic, high\\-visibility position suited to an adaptable professional who thrives at the intersection of strategy and execution. Depending on market needs, you may support new business initiatives through competitive intelligence and account research or manage a portfolio of accounts to ensure strong client relationships and delivery outcomes.\n   \n\n  \n\n****WHAT YOU'LL DO****\n**Market \\& Account Growth Acceleration**\n* Conduct account research and competitive landscape analysis to support account mining, strategic planning, and new market penetration.\n* Develop account briefs and intelligence reports that equip Business Development Leaders and Client Partners with actionable insights.\n* Collaborate on target industry mapping and identify partnership opportunities to fuel market growth.\n\n\n**Account \\& Delivery Alignment**\n* Manage a portfolio of assigned accounts, ensuring relationship continuity, governance adherence, and high client satisfaction.\n* Interface with Service Lines and Delivery teams to track milestones, surface risks, and provide Client Partners with timely visibility for decisions and client conversations.\n* Monitor contract renewals, delivery SLAs, and risk flags, proactively escalating issues as needed.\n\n\n**Sales Operations \\& Execution Orchestration**\n* Maintain CRM accuracy across pipelines, contacts, and opportunities ensuring data integrity and timely follow\\-up.\n* Track pursuits and client discussions, supporting execution discipline for Business Development Leaders and Client Partners.\n* Prepare dashboards, account plans, and governance reports to support market\\-level decision\\-making.\n* Coordinate proposal logistics with Service Line teams to ensure timely submissions and process compliance.\n\n\n****WHO YOU ARE****\n* Adaptable and fast learning, you flex comfortably between account management, research, and delivery coordination as business priorities shift.\n* Disciplined and dependable, you deliver with accuracy, follow\\-through, and consistency across time zones.\n* Analytical and insight\\-driven, you use data, market intelligence, and competitive research to surface opportunities and risks.\n* A confident communicator, with strong written and verbal skills, professional presence, and cross\\-cultural fluency.\n* Collaborative by nature, you work seamlessly through Business Development, Service Lines, and Delivery teams.\n* Proactive and curious, you anticipate needs, take initiative, and bring ideas that drive clients and market growth.\n\n\n****QUALIFICATIONS****\n* 2\u20135 years of post\\-MBA experience in business development, client management, sales operations, or management consulting.\n* Demonstrated ability to manage multiple priorities and stakeholders in a fast\\-paced, matrixed environment.\n* Proficiency with CRM tools and strong data management discipline.\n* Experience in IT services, consulting, or technology solutions is a plus.\n* Bachelor's degree required; MBA or equivalent postgraduate degree required.\n\n\n At YASH, you are empowered to create a career that will take you to where you want to go while working in an inclusive team environment. We leverage career\\-oriented skilling models and optimize our collective intelligence aided with technology for continuous learning, unlearning, and relearning at a rapid pace and scale.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Our Hyperlearning workplace is grounded upon four principles**\n* Flexible work arrangements, Free spirit, and emotional positivity\n* Agile self\\-determination, trust, transparency, and open collaboration\n* All Support needed for the realization of business goals,\n* Stable employment with a great atmosphere and ethical corporate culture\n\n\n Apply now \u00bb\n   \n\n  \n\n* Apply Now\n* Start apply with LinkedIn\n* Please wait...\n\n\n**Find Similar Jobs:**\n* Careers Home\n* View All Jobs\n* Top Jobs\n* Opens in a new tab.\n* Opens in a new tab.\n* Opens in a new tab.\n* Opens in a new tab.\n\n\n Quick Links\n   \n\n  \n\n* Blogs\n* Events\n* Webinars\n* Media\n\n\n Contact\n   \n\n  \n\n* Contact Us\n\n\n Copyright \u00a9 2020\\. YASH Technologies. All Rights Reserved.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4465989847","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4465989847"},{"title":"Creator Partnerships Executive","company":"The Other Craft","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467529240","source":"linkedin","skills":[104],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Creator Partnerships Executive \\| Hyderabad, India \\| Full\\-time \\| On\\-site** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Behind every great creator is someone who believed in them first.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why Build with \\#TheOtherCraft?** \n\n\n\n\n The Other Craft is where strategy, creativity, media and technology come together to build brands, businesses, creators and original intellectual property.\n \n\n\n\n We\u2019re building a trusted ecosystem of creators, artists and creative professionals who believe collaboration creates extraordinary work.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**You\u2019ll Spend Your Time\u2026** \n\n\n\n* Discovering talented creators across different creative fields.\n* Building long\\-term relationships with creators and creative communities.\n* Connecting the right creators with meaningful opportunities.\n* Growing The Other Craft\u2019s creator network.\n* Creating an ecosystem where great collaborations happen naturally.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**You Might Be a Great Fit If\u2026** \n\n\n\n* You love discovering talented people.\n* You naturally build strong relationships.\n* You enjoy bringing people together.\n* You\u2019re organized, dependable and proactive.\n* You believe great communities create great work.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What You\u2019ll Experience\u2026** \n\n\n\n* Build one of the most exciting creator ecosystems.\n* Work with creators, brands and leadership.\n* Learn how creative collaborations become successful businesses.\n* Help shape a community built on trust, creativity and growth.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**If you\u2019re looking to simply coordinate projects, this probably isn\u2019t for you.** \n\n\n\n\n**If you\u2019re passionate about building communities that create lasting value, we\u2019d love to hear from you.**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467529240","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467529240"},{"title":"Brand Partnerships Executive","company":"The Other Craft","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467523340","source":"linkedin","skills":[104,105,106],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Brand Partnerships Executive \\| Hyderabad, India \\| Full\\-time \\| On\\-site** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n***The best partnerships don\u2019t begin with a pitch. They begin with trust.***\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why Build With \\#TheOtherCraft?** \n\n\n\n* The Other Craft is where strategy, creativity, media and technology come together to build brands, businesses, creators and original intellectual property.\n* We\u2019re building a company for people who believe meaningful work is created through curiosity, ownership and collaboration\u2014not hierarchy.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**You\u2019ll Spend Your Time\u2026** \n\n\n\n* Building relationships with brands, businesses and decision\\-makers.\n* Identifying partnership opportunities that create long\\-term value.\n* Representing The Other Craft with confidence, professionalism and integrity.\n* Working closely with leadership to grow meaningful collaborations.\n* Opening doors that help great ideas reach the right people.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**You Might Be a Great Fit If\u2026** \n\n\n\n* You genuinely enjoy meeting people.\n* You communicate with confidence and empathy.\n* You believe partnerships are built on trust, not transactions.\n* You\u2019re proactive, dependable and naturally curious.\n* You enjoy helping businesses grow.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What You\u2019ll Experience\u2026** \n\n\n\n* Work directly with leadership.\n* Learn how modern brands build influence.\n* Contribute ideas that shape real business decisions.\n* Grow in an environment that values ownership, learning and long\\-term thinking.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**If you\u2019re looking for another sales job, this probably isn\u2019t for you.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**If you\u2019re looking to build relationships that create lasting impact, we\u2019d love to hear from you.**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467523340","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467523340"},{"title":"Account Management Associate, ISG-ESMA","company":"Amazon","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468266188","source":"linkedin","skills":[105,106,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Description**\n Through the Amazon Marketplace, Amazon provides individuals or enterprises the opportunity to sell their goods on the Amazon platform. Worldwide, more than a million sellers use this Marketplace and thereby contribute to the success of Amazon. We provide necessary support to new Sellers starting from their launch on Amazon to removing blockers and setting them up for success by leveraging various programs and tools. Amazon Services offers services to sellers in multiple countries to sell on Amazon websites globally and grow multi\\-channel commerce.\n   \n\n  \n\n We are looking for a highly motivated goal oriented individual to join our Seller management team at Hyderabad to provide support to our Selling Partners. The role would require high level of ownership and strategic thinking with a keen desire to work in a Sales/Business Development role. The successful candidate will have to thrive in an ambiguous environment by being a self\\-starter and an excellent decision maker who can keep calm and perform under pressure situations.\n   \n\n  \n\n Key job responsibilities\n   \n\n  \n\n* Recruiting Sellers onto various programs and managing Seller relationship by championing their needs at Amazon\n* Managing and driving the growth of the Sellers\u2019 business by adding selection and delivering on key business opportunities for Sellers\n* Managing key improvement initiatives and projects: Drive new product launches and relationship extensions by collaborating with the business development and on\\-boarding teams.\n* Working with Sellers to improve operational aspects of their business in providing a great consumer experience\n* Identifying specific prospects/partners to approach, communicating the specific value proposition for their business and establishing long\\-term, successful partnerships.\n* Tracking and reporting performance using appropriate metrics. Achieve productivity and seller satisfaction targets\n* Analyzing data to derive key insights and drive process improvement\n\n\n**Basic Qualifications**\n* 1\\+ years of sales experience\n* Bachelor's degree\n\n\n**Preferred Qualifications**\n* 2\\+ years of sales experience\n\n\n Our inclusive culture empowers Amazonians to deliver the best results for our customers. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please visit https://amazon.jobs/content/en/how\\-we\\-hire/accommodations for more information. If the country/region you\u2019re applying in isn\u2019t listed, please contact your Recruiting Partner.\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n**Company** \n \\- Amazon Dev Center India \\- Hyderabad\n   \n\n  \n\n Job ID: A10544455","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468266188","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468266188"},{"title":"Lead Generation Specialist","company":"Alien Technology Transfer","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468214823","source":"linkedin","experience":"Lead","skills":[33,105],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Alien Technology Transfer** \n empowers top\\-class innovators to transform visionary product concepts into commercial realities. We do this by helping companies with concrete growth ambitions to secure funding for their product development through our innovation consulting expertise. To date, we have raised more than $700 million for our clients \\- Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) \\- across many domains, including agri\\-tech, artificial intelligence, biotechnology, clean\\-tech, cyber\\-security, quantum computing, space, and transport.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We are looking for a\n **Lead Generation Specialist** \n able to source and analyse the highest\\-quality prospects for our business lines among the most innovative high\\-tech, high\\-impact start\\-ups and Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) in Europe and the USA.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* **Contract Type:** \n Permanent\n* **Hybrid Work Modality:** \n Monday to Thursday at the Office and Friday Work from Home\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n To join the team, you must have a genuine interest in technology and business, an aptitude for quickly understanding complex engineering or medical innovations, be highly analytical and articulate, and have a strong command of English. You must be a team player, well\\-organised, and keen to take on responsibility. Key qualities include demonstrating an entrepreneurial mindset, being highly self\\-motivated, and having the stamina to work in an ambitious, goal\\-driven environment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The role will see you take responsibility for scouting potential clients, mainly by leveraging digital resources and channels (search engines, industry websites, and events), and by analysing various databases (which also involve some software programming tasks).\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES** \n\n\n\n* Keeping yourself continuously up to date in the technological and business field to quickly and effectively recognise business opportunities and industry/market emerging trends;\n* Continuously identifying top\\-level sources/hubs of potential clients among web platforms, online databases, events (trade fairs, conferences, pitches, start\\-up competitions, etc);\n* Handling and analysing databases, including any applicable customised filtering option to deliver the most appropriate results;\n* Analysing and critically evaluating information resulting from any search related to innovative technologies and businesses;\n* Maintaining and enriching internal databases for prospects, clients, and public grant awardees.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**JOB REQUIREMENTS** \n\n\n\n* Must have at least a Master\u2019s degree in Life Science (Bioengineering, Biomedical, Biotechnology, Neurosciences, Biochemistry, Microbiology, etc);\n* Advanced use of Excel and aptitude to master the use of professional industry database;\n* Proficiency in using digital resources (e.g. search engines) to uncover new leads;\n* Self\\-starting, inquisitive, and pragmatic attitude;\n* Fluent English comprehension, oral and written;\n* Knowledge of web scraping/extraction mechanisms is a plus;\n* Competence in creating web scrapers to extract startup data from different websites, supporting the development of a startup Lead Generation, is a plus.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Please note: Due to the high volume of applications, we are unfortunately unable to provide individual feedback on the outcome of every application.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468214823","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468214823"},{"title":"Content Writer & Content Strategist","company":"aptapace","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468388789","source":"linkedin","experience":"3 Yrs","skills":[9,103,105,107,108,109,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Company:** \n\n Aptapace Innovative Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\n \n\n\n\n\n**Location:** \n\n Kondapur, Hyderabad\n \n\n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n\n 1\u20133 Years\n \n\n\n\n\n**Employment Type:** \n\n Full\\-Time\n \n\n\n\n\n**Salary:** \n\n Up to \u20b93 LPA\n \n\n\n\n\n**Work Requirement:** \n\n Must have their own laptop.\n \n\n\n\n**About the Role** \n\n\n Aptapace Innovative Technologies Pvt. Ltd. is looking for a\n \n**creative, research\\-driven, and SEO\\-focused Content Writer \\& Content Strategist** \n\n to develop high\\-quality content that improves search visibility, user engagement, and lead generation.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n The role involves creating content for\n \n**websites, SaaS products, blogs, landing pages, social media, and digital marketing campaigns** \n\n .\n \n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n**SEO \\& Content Writing** \n* Create SEO\\-optimized blogs, articles, guides, website, and product content.\n* Conduct keyword research and understand search intent.\n* Optimise titles, headings, meta descriptions, URLs, internal links, and content structure.\n* Create people\\-first, informative, and engaging content.\n* Update existing content based on SEO performance.\n\n\n**Website \\& Product Content** \n* Develop website and high\\-converting landing\\-page content.\n* Write headlines, CTAs, FAQs, product descriptions, and feature content.\n* Create clear and engaging content for\n \n**Resident360, Yeseo. online, and other SaaS products** \n\n .\n* Simplify technical concepts for customers and general audiences.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n**Content Marketing \\& Strategy** \n* Create content for LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, Reddit, X, YouTube, and email campaigns.\n* Develop monthly content calendars and content strategies.\n* Identify new topics, keyword opportunities, topic clusters, and pillar pages.\n* Research competitors and identify content gaps and opportunities.\n\n\n**SEO Performance** \n* Monitor organic traffic, keyword rankings, impressions, CTR, engagement, and conversions.\n* Use performance data to improve content quality and search visibility.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n**Required Skills** \n* Excellent English writing, grammar, and proofreading skills.\n* Strong understanding of SEO and search intent.\n* Experience in keyword research and long\\-form SEO content.\n* Ability to write website and landing\\-page copy.\n* Strong research and content structuring skills.\n* Basic knowledge of\n \n**Google Search Console and Google Analytics** \n\n .\n* Familiarity with\n \n**Ahrefs, Semrush, Ubersuggest, or similar SEO tools** \n\n .\n* Ability to understand and simplify technology/SaaS concepts.\n\n\n**Good to Have** \n* SaaS, technology, or B2B content experience.\n* Local SEO knowledge.\n* WordPress experience.\n* Conversion copywriting skills.\n* Social media and press\\-release writing experience.\n* Experience using AI content tools.\n\n\n**AI \\& Content Tools** \n\n\n Candidates should be comfortable using\n \n**ChatGPT or similar AI tools** \n\n for research, ideation, outlines, keyword clustering, optimisation, and proofreading.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n AI should be used as a\n \n**productivity tool** \n\n , with proper fact\\-checking, editing, originality, and human\\-focused content quality maintained.\n \n\n\n\n\n**Candidate Profile** \n\n\n\n\n\n We are looking for someone who is:\n \n\n\n\n* Creative and research\\-oriented.\n* Strong in English communication.\n* SEO\\-focused and detail\\-oriented.\n* Interested in technology and SaaS.\n* A quick learner with strong analytical skills.\n* Able to work independently and meet deadlines.\n* Comfortable collaborating with marketing, product, and development teams.\n\n\n**Qualification** \n* Bachelor\u2019s degree in\n \n**English, Journalism, Mass Communication, Marketing, Communications, or a related field** \n\n is preferred.\n* Relevant experience will also be considered.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n**Key Performance Indicators** \n\n\n Performance will be evaluated based on:\n \n\n\n\n* Content quality and originality.\n* SEO optimisation and search visibility.\n* Organic traffic and keyword growth.\n* Content engagement and conversions.\n* Timely delivery and accuracy.\n\n\n**Interested Candidates** \n\n**Contact Person:** \n\n Reshma Reddy Tippani (HR)\n \n\n\n\n\n**WhatsApp:** \n\n \\+91 9701870667\n \n\n\n\n\n**Email:** \n\n hr.reshma@aptapace.com","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468388789","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468388789"},{"title":"Graphic Designer & Video Editor | 0\u20131 Years | We\u2019re Hiring","company":"CustomFurnish","location":"Hyderabad","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468382106","source":"linkedin","skills":[107,116],"is_walkin":false,"description":"CustomFurnish is looking for a creative Graphic Designer \\& Video Editor \u2013 Social Media to join our growing marketing team.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n If you enjoy creating eye\\-catching designs, editing engaging Reels, and capturing beautiful interior spaces, we\u2019d love to hear from you!\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n What You\u2019ll Do\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \ud83c\udfa8 Create social media posts and marketing creatives\n \n\n\n\n \ud83c\udfac Edit engaging Reels and short\\-form videos\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udcf9 Shoot quality videos of our showroom and completed client homes\n \n\n\n\n \u2728 Capture the best angles, details, and design elements from our projects\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udcf1 Create content for Instagram, Facebook, and other social platforms\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udca1 Bring fresh and trending ideas for social media content\n \n\n\n\n \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Handle basic Figma design requirements\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \ud83d\udccd Location:\n **Serilingampally, Hyderabad** \n\n\n\n\n \ud83d\udcbc Position:\n **Graphic Designer \\& Video Editor \u2013 Social Media (0\\-1\\)Years** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \ud83d\udce9 Interested? Send your resume to:\n \n\n\n\n**wecare@customfurnish.com** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Join CustomFurnish and turn beautiful spaces into engaging content! \ud83d\ude80\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* \\#Hiring \\#GraphicDesigner \\#VideoEditor \\#SocialMediaJobs \\#ReelsCreator \\#HyderabadJobs \\#CustomFurnish \\#CreativeJobs \\#WeAreHiring","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468382106","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468382106"},{"title":"Performance Marketing Manager","company":"Cleevo","location":"Chennai","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467534239","source":"linkedin","experience":"Manager","skills":[107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**About Cleevo** \n\n\n\n\n Most cleaning brands sell you water in a big plastic bottle. Cleevo sells the concentrate Non toxic \\& premium performance at a fair price. It's a better product and a better unit economic, and we're scaling it hard across D2C and e \\- commerce. We're looking for the person who can turn that edge into a growth engine.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**The role** \n\n\n\n* **Location** \n : Chennai \\- on\\-site with the founding team\n* **Type** \n : Full\\-time\n* **Level** \n : Senior \\- this is a key hire, not a seat to fill\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What you'll own** \n\n\n\n* Full\\-funnel performance on Meta \\- you own the spend, the ROAS, and the scaling calls\n* Large monthly budgets, scaled aggressively without torching efficiency\n* Account structure, testing frameworks, audience and exclusion hygiene \\- the plumbing that makes scale possible\n* A creative\\-first approach: partnering tightly on hooks, angles, and formats, because at our scale creative is the real lever, not bid tweaks\n* Ownership of the numbers and reading blended efficiency with true unit economics, not just dashboard ROAS\n* Working shoulder\\-to\\-shoulder with the founder \\- this is a build role, not a maintain role\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Who you are** \n\n\n\n* 3\\+ years of D2C performance marketing, ideally in a consumer brand\n* Have personally handled large monthly budgets and scaled them\n* Understand the entire funnel from acquisition through retention economics\n* Creative\\-first: you think about what the ad says, not just what it costs\n* Comfortable with ambiguity and heavy ownership; you want to build, not run someone else's playbook Based in or willing to move to Chennai \\- this is on\\-site with the founding team\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Bonus** \n\n\n\n* Experience scaling a brand from \\~\u20b91cr to several cr/month\n* Hands\\-on with creative testing pipelines or UGC at volume\n* Ecomm ads depth alongside Meta\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**How to apply** \n\n\n\n\n Write to mayank@getcleevo.com","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467534239","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467534239"},{"title":"Digital Marketing Expert / Content Creator","company":"CodeMark Media","location":"Chennai","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467193693","source":"linkedin","experience":"2 Yrs","skills":[9,103,105,107,108,109,115,117],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**ABOUT THE JOB** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Location: Nungambakkam, Chennai\n \n\n\n\n Job Type: Full\\-Time \\| On\\-site\n \n\n\n\n Experience: 6 Months \u2013 2 Years\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We\u2019re hiring a Digital Marketing Expert to join our team at CodeMark Media.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We\u2019re looking for someone who combines digital marketing knowledge with creativity and strong content skills. You\u2019ll work across social media, content creation, SEO, paid advertising and lead generation for CodeMark Media and our clients.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Content creation is a major part of this role. You should be comfortable coming up with creative ideas, writing scripts and captions, planning reels, and appearing in front of the camera for social media videos.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**JOB RESPONSIBILITIES** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Plan and execute digital marketing strategies for multiple brands and clients.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create engaging content ideas for Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook and other social platforms.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Develop concepts, hooks, scripts, captions and copy for reels, posts, carousels and campaigns.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Be comfortable appearing in reels, promotional videos and other social media content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Plan and manage social media content calendars.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Coordinate with graphic designers and video editors to turn content ideas into high\\-quality creatives.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Manage and optimise Google Ads and Meta Ads campaigns.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Handle On\\-Page, Off\\-Page and Local SEO activities.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Perform keyword research, competitor analysis and market research.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Plan and execute lead\\-generation campaigns.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Monitor campaign performance, engagement, leads and conversions.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Prepare reports and continuously optimise campaigns based on performance.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Stay updated with social media trends, content formats, platform updates and digital marketing tools.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**REQUIRED SKILLS** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 6 months \u2013 2 years of hands\\-on digital marketing experience.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong content ideation, copywriting, caption writing and scriptwriting skills.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Confident and comfortable speaking and appearing in front of the camera.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Good understanding of Instagram Reels and short\\-form video content.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Hands\\-on knowledge of SEO and keyword research.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience with Google Ads and Meta Ads Manager.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Familiarity with Google Analytics (GA4\\), Google Search Console and Google Business Profile.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Understanding of lead generation and campaign optimisation.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to identify trends and turn them into relevant content ideas.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Familiarity with Canva and basic content creation tools.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to use AI tools such as ChatGPT, Claude or Gemini for research, content ideation and marketing productivity.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Good communication, creativity and teamwork skills.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**GOOD TO HAVE** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience creating Instagram Reels or short\\-form videos.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Previous experience appearing in brand or social media videos.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Basic video editing knowledge using CapCut, Premiere Pro or similar tools.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Basic graphic design skills using Canva or Adobe tools.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience handling multiple client social media accounts.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Familiarity with WordPress.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Previous digital marketing agency experience.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**WHAT WE OFFER** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Competitive salary package.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Friendly and creative work environment.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Opportunity to work on real client campaigns across different industries.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Hands\\-on exposure to content creation, SEO, social media and paid advertising.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Opportunities to learn, experiment and grow professionally.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Creative freedom to bring new ideas to campaigns and content.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**JOB DETAILS** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Position: Digital Marketing Expert\n \n\n\n\n Department: Digital Marketing\n \n\n\n\n Experience: 6 Months \u2013 2 Years\n \n\n\n\n Location: Nungambakkam, Chennai\n \n\n\n\n Job Type: Full\\-Time\n \n\n\n\n Work Mode: On\\-site\n \n\n\n\n Interview: On\\-site\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n If you\u2019re creative, understand digital marketing, enjoy creating content and are confident in front of the camera, we\u2019d love to hear from you.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Apply with your resume and, if available, share your portfolio, social media work, reels or other content samples.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467193693","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467193693"},{"title":"Social Media Marketing Specialist","company":"Metayb","location":"Chennai","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468613303","source":"linkedin","experience":"5 Yrs","skills":[25,29,41,43,103,105,106,107,112,115],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**About Metayb**\n Metayb is a digital transformation company on a mission to transform seamlessly by empowering organisations to navigate the vast landscape of the digital\\-first era. We have grown into a close\\-knit family of\n **500\\+ employees** \n , each possessing rich field expertise. Metayb focuses on fostering seamless customer experiences, enhancing operational efficiency, and deriving actionable insights. By harnessing the power of emerging technologies, Metayb aims to be the unparalleled choice for global customers, delivering strategic goals effectively within a digital\\-first ecosystem of value creation.\n   \n\n  \n\n Our key areas of expertise lie in\n **Digital Transformation, Data Science, SAP Implementation, Workflow Automation, Dashboarding, Visualization, Finance, and Supply Chain Services** \n . We strongly aspire to venture into\n **IoT, AI/ML, and Virtual Reality** \n . Metayb endeavours to be best\\-in\\-class across digital solutions, infrastructure, and product engineering.\n   \n\n  \n\n Role Overview\n   \n\n  \n\n We are looking for an experienced\n **Social Media Marketing Specialist** \n to drive Metayb\u2019s digital presence across\n **B2B and B2C audiences** \n .\n   \n\n  \n\n The role will focus on strengthening\n **brand awareness, growing online communities, driving social engagement, building employee advocacy, supporting lead generation, and executing digital and AI\\-led campaigns** \n across relevant social media platforms.\n   \n\n  \n\n The ideal candidate should have strong hands\\-on experience with\n **Meta platforms and advertising tools** \n , social media analytics, content\\-led campaigns, influencer collaborations, e\\-commerce platforms such as\n **Shopify** \n , and tracking technologies such as\n **Meta Pixel and conversion tracking** \n . The candidate should be comfortable using data and insights to optimise campaigns and improve brand and business outcomes.\n   \n\n  \n\n Key Responsibilities\n   \n\n  \n\n \ud83d\udd39 Social Media \\& Brand Management\n   \n\n  \n\n* Develop and execute social media strategies across B2B and B2C audiences to strengthen brand awareness and digital presence.\n* Manage and grow Metayb\u2019s presence across platforms such as LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, and other relevant social channels.\n* Plan and maintain an effective social media content calendar aligned with brand, business, campaign, and marketing objectives.\n* Create and execute campaigns focused on brand awareness, reach, engagement, community growth, and lead generation.\n* Monitor social media trends, platform updates, audience behaviour, and emerging content formats to identify opportunities for growth.\n* Maintain consistency in brand messaging, tone, visual communication, and digital presence across social platforms.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Community Growth \\& Social Engagement\n   \n\n  \n\n* Build, manage, and grow relevant online communities around the brand, products, services, and industry.\n* Drive meaningful conversations and engagement with followers, prospects, customers, partners, and industry audiences.\n* Monitor comments, messages, mentions, and social conversations and ensure timely and appropriate engagement.\n* Develop initiatives to improve community participation, follower quality, engagement rates, and brand affinity.\n* Identify relevant conversations, industry trends, and topical opportunities to increase organic visibility.\n* Track community and engagement performance and continuously identify opportunities for improvement.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Employee Advocacy \\& Employer Branding\n   \n\n  \n\n* Develop and execute employee advocacy programmes to encourage employees to actively engage with and amplify Metayb\u2019s content.\n* Create campaigns and initiatives that enable employees to become authentic brand ambassadors across social platforms.\n* Collaborate with HR and internal teams to support employer branding, employee engagement, hiring campaigns, and workplace storytelling.\n* Develop content initiatives that showcase employee experiences, expertise, achievements, events, and organisational culture.\n* Track employee advocacy performance and identify opportunities to increase organic brand reach.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Paid Social Media \\& Meta Marketing\n   \n\n  \n\n* Plan, execute, and optimise paid campaigns across Meta platforms including Facebook and Instagram.\n* Manage campaigns across objectives such as awareness, engagement, traffic, conversions, remarketing, and lead generation.\n* Work hands\\-on with Meta Ads Manager, Meta Business Suite, Meta Audience tools, Ads Reporting, and campaign optimisation tools.\n* Develop and test different audiences, creatives, ad formats, messaging, placements, and campaign strategies.\n* Monitor campaign performance and optimise budgets based on CPC, CPM, CTR, CPL, conversions, ROAS, and other relevant metrics.\n* Implement and monitor Meta Pixel, conversion tracking, events, custom audiences, lookalike audiences, and retargeting campaigns.\n* Identify opportunities to improve campaign performance through A/B testing and data\\-driven optimisation.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 AI\\-Led Campaigns \\& Digital Marketing\n   \n\n  \n\n* Support the development and execution of AI\\-led marketing campaigns across social and digital channels.\n* Explore and leverage AI tools for content creation, campaign ideation, audience insights, personalisation, creative development, and marketing automation.\n* Experiment with AI\\-driven content formats and campaigns to improve engagement, reach, and lead generation.\n* Stay updated on emerging AI marketing tools, generative AI capabilities, social media trends, and automation opportunities.\n* Collaborate with internal teams to translate AI and technology capabilities into engaging social media campaigns and digital narratives.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Influencer \\& Partnership Marketing\n   \n\n  \n\n* Identify and collaborate with relevant influencers, creators, industry experts, thought leaders, and digital communities.\n* Develop and execute influencer campaigns aligned with brand awareness, engagement, community growth, and lead\\-generation objectives.\n* Manage influencer outreach, campaign coordination, content requirements, timelines, and performance tracking.\n* Evaluate influencer and creator performance based on reach, engagement, audience relevance, conversions, and campaign outcomes.\n* Build long\\-term relationships with relevant creators and industry communities.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 E\\-Commerce \\& Conversion Tracking\n   \n\n  \n\n* Manage and support social media campaigns for e\\-commerce and digital commerce platforms, including Shopify and similar platforms.\n* Develop campaigns that drive website traffic, product discovery, customer engagement, and conversions.\n* Work with Shopify and other e\\-commerce platforms to support campaign tracking, landing pages, product promotions, and conversion journeys.\n* Implement and monitor Meta Pixel, events, conversion APIs/hooks, and other relevant tracking mechanisms.\n* Work closely with web, product, and marketing teams to ensure accurate tracking of campaign performance and customer journeys.\n* Analyse campaign and website data to identify opportunities to improve conversion rates and customer acquisition.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Lead Generation \\& Analytics\n   \n\n  \n\n* Plan and execute social media initiatives focused on qualified lead generation across B2B and B2C segments.\n* Work closely with sales and marketing teams to align social media campaigns with business and lead\\-generation objectives.\n* Track and analyse reach, impressions, engagement, traffic, leads, conversions, CPL, CAC, and campaign ROI.\n* Prepare regular social media and campaign performance reports with actionable insights.\n* Use analytics and audience data to refine content strategy, targeting, campaign messaging, and channel performance.\n* Continuously test and optimise campaigns to improve overall marketing effectiveness.\n\n\n \ud83d\udd39 Cross\\-Functional Collaboration\n   \n\n  \n\n* Collaborate with Marketing, Sales, HR, Product, Creative, Technology, and Business teams to develop relevant social media campaigns.\n* Work with creative teams to develop social media creatives, videos, reels, campaign assets, and other digital content.\n* Translate business objectives and product/service propositions into compelling social media communication.\n* Coordinate with internal stakeholders to ensure timely execution of campaigns, launches, events, and announcements.\n* Support digital marketing initiatives across both B2B and B2C business segments.\n* Stay informed about competitor activity and industry trends to identify relevant opportunities for Metayb.\n\n\n**Qualifications**\n* Bachelor's Degree in Marketing, Communications, Digital Marketing, Mass Communication, Business Administration, or a related field.\n* 4\u20135 years of experience in Social Media Marketing, Digital Marketing, Social Media Management, or a related role.\n* Proven experience managing social med