 will be determined based on the candidate\u2019s performance during the interview process, relevant experience, and alignment with the organizational hierarchy.*","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468613303","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468613303"},{"title":"Team Lead \u2013 Social Media & Content","company":"TAFE - Tractors and Farm Equipment Limited","location":"Chennai","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467181705","source":"linkedin","experience":"Lead","skills":[100,103,106,107,109],"is_walkin":false,"description":"The role will lead the social media and content strategy for a leading and iconic Indian tractor brand, and will be responsible for creating, executing, and managing all organic and creative content initiatives across digital platforms. It will also be responsible for crafting compelling brand narratives, fostering community engagement, and analysing content performance to derive insights for improved reach, engagement, and brand affinity. The goal is to strengthen the brand\u2019s voice, build a loyal digital community, and support business growth through impactful storytelling and creative excellence.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Principal Accountabilities \\-** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Social Media Strategy \\& Execution\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* Develop and oversee the brand\u2019s social media strategy across platforms (Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, LinkedIn, X, etc.)\n* Plan and execute content calendars aligned with product launches, campaigns, and seasonal priorities\n* Monitor trends, platform updates, and audience behavior to inform strategy and content formats\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Creative Direction \\& Content Production\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* Lead ideation and production of high\\-quality visual and written content (videos, reels, carousels, infographics, etc.)\n* Collaborate with designers, copywriters, photographers, and videographers to ensure timely and brand\\-aligned output\n* Ensure 