gn Reporting \\| Client Presentations**","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467173987","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467173987"},{"title":"Corporate Communications Specialist","company":"Buckman","location":"Chennai","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4457980048","source":"linkedin","skills":[103,104,107,112],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Description**\n Job Responsibilities/Task to accomplish/Territory\n   \n\n  \n\n* Deliver integrated change and corporate communications by developing strategies, tactics, and measurement across internal functions (HR, IT, Finance, Operations, C\\-suite)\n* Support town halls, leadership meetings, and strategic announcements\n* Partner with marketing and product teams to build awareness of new products and campaigns\n* Establish communication KPIs and dashboards and measure employee engagement and campaign effectiveness\n* Coordinate PR and marketing programs with key internal stakeholders\n* Maintain press release archive\n* Work with strategic markets to develop media aligned with corporate goals\n* Maintain and develop active press kits and media contact lists\n* Develop PR plans\n* Find and develop PR partners and agencies\n* Work with SHE department to develop sustainability report\n* Recommend ways to integrate ESG initiatives into regular communications\n* Assist in customer sustainability questionnaires\n* Develop thought leadership content.\n* Coordinate LinkedIn communications.\n* Monitor brand perception and external engagement\n\n\n**Qualifications (necessary For Any Candidate For This Position)**\n* Bachelor's degree in Communications, Public Relations, Journalism, Marketing, or related field\n* Master's degree in Corporate Communications, Strategic Communications, or MBA with marketing focus\n* 7\\-10\\+ years of progressive experience in corporate communications, public relations, or related field","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4457980048","perm