n\n\n\n \u2022 Email and WhatsApp campaigns\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Project and campaign content\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Customer education and lifestyle content\n \n\n\n\n The expectation is simple:\n **content that performs, not content for the sake of content.** \n\n\n\n\n**Nurture \\& Lifecycle** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Build content journeys for different lead segments\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Create email and WhatsApp nurture campaigns\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Re engage dormant and inactive leads\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Personalise content based on customer stage and intent\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Improve engagement and conversion across our existing database\n \n\n\n\n**AI for Marketing** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Use ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude and other AI tools for research, ideation and production\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Build AI workflows and prompts that improve quality and speed\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Repurpose content across multiple formats\n \n\n\n\n**Website** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Publish and optimise website content\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Manage blogs and landing page content\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Improve readability, SEO and conversion\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Who We\u2019re Looking For\n \n \u2022 2\u20134 years of experience in SEO and content marketing\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Excellent copywriting and storytelling skills\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong understanding of SEO fundamentals\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Working knowledge of GEO and AEO\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience with WordPress or similar CMS\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Familiarity with Search Console, GA4 and SEO tools\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Comfortable using AI tools for marketing\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Real estate experience is a plus\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n What Success Looks Like\n \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You\u2019ll be measured on:\n \n\n\n\n**Organic growth \\| Search visibility \\| AI discoverability \\| Content conversions \\| Nurture engagement \\| Lead reactivation** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n One Important Thing\n \n**This is not a social media content role.** \n\n\n\n\n We\u2019re looking for someone who understands how content can\n **get discovered, build trust, nurture intent and drive business growth.** \n\n\n\n\n If you believe every piece of content should have a job to do, we\u2019d like to hear from you.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467165792","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467165792"},{"title":"Marketing Manager | IT / SaaS / Compliance","company":"STEIGEN ELEVATORS","location":"Bangalore","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467511488","source":"linkedin","experience":"3 Yrs","skills":[102,104,105,107,108],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Hiring: Marketing Manager \\| IT / SaaS / Compliance**\n We are looking for an experienced\n **Marketing Manager** \n with strong hands\\-on execution capabilities, team management experience, and global exposure.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Key Responsibilities**\n* Own and execute marketing strategy across content, design, SEO, email, webinars, events, and performance marketing.\n* Coordinate across teams to ensure aligned, timely, and high\\-quality execution.\n* Oversee website content, case studies, whitepapers, newsletters, and other marketing collaterals.\n* Manage and monitor SEO, email, webinars, events, and paid campaigns.\n* Continuously optimize campaigns for leads, conversions, and engagement.\n* Track performance, identify gaps, and implement data\\-driven improvements.\n* Lead brainstorming sessions and contribute new marketing ideas.\n* Stay updated on market trends, industry developments, and competitor activities.\n* Act as the bridge between management strategy and execution by converting plans into actionable tasks.\n* Take complete ownership of marketing deliverables and step in hands\\-on when required.\n* Ensure deadlines, accountability, and outcome\\-driven execution.\n* Review, guide, and improve the output of the marketing team.\n\n\n**Mandatory Requirements**\n* Minimum 3 years of relevant digital marketing experience.\n* Candidates from IT / SaaS / C