, market trends, and competitor offerings.\n* Motivation to work in a performance\\-driven environment, with a focus on meeting and exceeding targets.\n* Ability to work on\\-site in Bengaluru, collaborate within a team, and build professional relationships with customers and colleagues.\n* Strong organizational skills, reliability, and a high level of professionalism in daily interactions.\n* Preferred: Bachelor\u2019s degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.\n* Preferred: Prior experience in sales, direct marketing, or business development, though entry\\-level candidates with strong potential are encouraged to apply.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468359810","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468359810"},{"title":"B2B Saas Paid Media Marketing Manager","company":"Applicantz","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468354034","source":"linkedin","experience":"Manager","skills":[103,105,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"THIS IS A LONG TERM CONTRACT POSITION WITH ONE OF THE LARGEST, GLOBAL, TECHNOLOGY LEADER\n **.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Our large, Fortune Technology client is ranked as one of the best companies to work with, in the world. As a global leader in 3D design, engineering, and entertainment software, they foster progressive culture, creativity, and a flexible work environment. They use cutting\\-edge technologies to keep themselves ahead of the curve. Diversity in all aspects is respected. Integrity, experience, honesty, people, humanity, and passion for excellence are some other adjectives that define this global technology leader.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We are looking for an experienced B2B Saas Paid Media Marketing Manager to lead integrated digital media planning and execution that drives brand awareness, engagement, and measurable business outcomes. The ideal candidate should have a strong background in digital media strategy, campaign optimization, and stakeholder management, with experience in the\n **B2B SaaS** \n industry.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Minimum Qualifications** \n\n\n\n* 5\\+ years of experience in Digital Media Strategy \\& Planning.\n* Experience managing both\n **performance marketing** \n (Lead Generation/eCommerce) and\n **brand campaigns** \n .\n* Strong understanding of the\n **Indian digital media landscape** \n , platforms, and consumer behavior within the\n **B2B SaaS** \n industry.\n* Hands\\-on experience with digital media planning tools, ad tech platforms, and analytics/reporting solutions.\n* Proven experience developing integrated media strategies across\n **Search, Social, Programmatic, Display, and Video** \n channels.\n* Strong analytical, stakeholder management, negotiation, and communication skills.\n* Experience managing multiple campaigns and cross\\-functional stakeholders.\n* Prior agency experience is highly preferred.\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n* Partner with business stakeholders to understand campaign objectives, target audiences, budgets, and success metrics.\n* Develop integrated digital media strategies aligned with business and marketing objectives.\n* Recommend the optimal media mix and investment strategy across digital channels.\n* Leverage consumer insights, market research, competitive intelligence, and historical performance to inform media planning.\n* Translate media strategies into actionable plans with defined KPIs and measurement frameworks.\n* Collaborate with media agencies and internal stakeholders to execute campaigns from planning through delivery.\n* Monitor campaign performance and optimize campaigns to maximize efficiency, ROI, and business outcomes.\n* Maintain campaign reporting frameworks and present actionable insights to business stakeholders.\n* Deliver post\\-campaign analyses with recommendations for future optimization and investment decisions.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468354034","permanent_url":"h